	<!-- Sender: GooseA on LD1 sends DataSet SetA naming LD2/GGIO1 and LD1/PTOC1; GooseB, a report and values beside it; LD3, LN XCBR1, LN GGIO2 and AP2 named by nothing; its connection holds both GOOSE addresses -->
